    },
    {
      "id": "claim_16929e4192694f9e88e21b2df6f1eb58",
      "statement": "default_model_pair() is the deployment-level terminal fallback: it reads LLM_MODEL_ID and LLM_REASONING_EFFORT, validates that the resulting model is supported and default-eligible, and raises ValueError for an unsupported model or effort.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agent/dashboard/options.py#L319-L333",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b3aa64d090d5af77d9db2fcf152eb29a5e8cd02bb924158d6b0c1cd4ea7b90f9:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6542ad2cef5747e9b221dffc6d2cf2e0",
      "statement": "For a hosted agent run, the factory seeds team main/subagent defaults, applies a profile only when no stored thread model exists, then uses stored thread settings when present; a valid explicit configurable agent_model_id/agent_effort is the mechanism that replaces that snapshot and the resolved settings are persisted back to the thread.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agent/utils/thread_settings.py#L45-L83",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:93092d28d24c0843a46c7eb3dc4a6733681b7af6ba2432aeb056f7d42cb9073e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e59a92170ddb46c3bb8ad6afdb3a6042",
      "statement": "agent_overrides.resolve_agent_model_id resolves a supported per-thread id over a valid profile override over the team default, while dashboard thread run creation via _resolve_agent_model_choice resolves a valid request pair over profile over team default and leaves the team default for a deprecated request.",
      "evidence": [
