      "statement": "Per-user custom instructions live in their own ['user_instructions'] namespace keyed by GitHub login (capped at 20,000 chars) precisely because they can be written both from the dashboard Profile tab and by the agent's save_user_instructions tool, so the two writers do not clobber each other.",
